# 4) Why this version is better

Compared with raw JSON prompting, this gives you:

## Better output consistency
The model is constrained to your schema.

## Fewer parse failures
No more hoping it avoids markdown fences or commentary.

## Cleaner backend logic
You’re validating an object, not cleaning up freeform text first.

## Easier prompt iteration
You can change behavior without disturbing output shape as much.

