# 7) What this will catch well

These heuristics are especially good at finding:

## Structural-but-bad outputs
Example:
- valid schema
- but `today` has 9 items
- or next actions are all “work on X”

## Missed dependency handling
Example:
- input says “waiting on finance”
- blockers comes back empty

## Missed decision handling
Example:
- input says “not sure whether…”
- open questions is empty

## Bad overwhelm behavior
Example:
- overwhelmed input
- output gives 7 next actions and 8 today items

## Forced drafts
Example:
- sparse ambiguous input
- output creates 4 random messages

