# 7) Recommended interpretation

Look at these in order:

## 1. Success count
If one prompt fails structurally more often, that matters immediately.

## 2. Avg heuristic score
Good high-level signal.

## 3. Min heuristic score
Important for reliability.
A prompt with high average but terrible worst-case behavior may still be risky.

## 4. Repeated failed checks
These are gold.
They tell you exactly what keeps going wrong.

