# 8) How to interpret the new cost fields

## Avg Cost/Run
How much a typical single generation costs.

Useful for:
- live product economics
- deciding default model

## Total Cost
How much the whole eval suite cost.

Useful for:
- experimentation budgeting
- CI evaluation cost awareness

## Quality/$
A rough efficiency metric:
- higher = more heuristic score per dollar

This is not perfect, but it’s very useful for model tradeoff decisions.

